      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The zombie horse's previous action was a jaws Strike that dealt damage to its target</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> the zombie horse makes a second jaws Strike as it violently gnashes its teeth and bites deep into the target's flesh. On a success, the target takes an additional 1d4 persistent bleed damage.</p>",
